adc_off_leak_1uA
Vbat bat 0 4.2
Ven ctl 0 0
Rgate bat gate 100k
Ren ctl 0 100k
Mn gate ctl 0 0 NENV
Dn 0 gate BODY
Mp switched gate bat bat PENV
Dp switched bat BODY
Ileak bat switched 1e-06
Rtop switched adc 150k
Rbottom adc 0 100k
Cfilter adc 0 100n
.model NENV NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=1.5 KP=0.005 LAMBDA=0.01 RD=2 RS=2 CGSO=100p CGDO=100p)
.model PENV PMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=-1.5 KP=0.002 LAMBDA=0.01 RD=5 RS=5 CGSO=50p CGDO=50p)
.model BODY D (IS=1p N=1.2 RS=1 CJO=20p)
.tran 100u 60m
.end
